==Battleground==
===<u>Chapters 1 & 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Doge|B.B.Bunny|Squire Rel|Those Guys|Jackie Peng|Sir Seal}}
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26 seconds<sup>780f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Sir Seal|Doge|B.B.Bunny|Squire Rel|Those Guys|Jackie Peng}}
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 19.33 seconds<sup>580f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly simple stage with no [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] threats. Kill the Sir Seal with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]].

